{"sourceUrl":"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:20.720603+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年招收全日制学术学位硕士研究生</span><a href=\"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>【</span><span>080900电子科学与技术】</span></span><span>、</span><span>【</span><span>140100 集成电路科学与工程</span><span><span>】和全日制专业学位硕士研究生【</span><span>085400电子信息】</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>研究生预推免（含直博）</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>预推免报名通知以学校官网发布为准。</span></p>\n<p><span>欢迎微电子科学与工程、集成电路设计与集成系统、电子科学与技术、电子信息工程等电子信息相关专业，以及测控、电气、计算机、材料等相关专业的优秀应届本科毕业生报考。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>推免考核</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>具体考核安排后续通知。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>招生人数</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年硕士生招生指标</span>1</span><span>6</span><span>0人左右</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sic.hnu.edu.cn/info/1115/2407.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>考试科目</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>初试自命题科目暂定为</span><span>“863数字与模拟电子技术”，以湖南大学研究生院发布的信息为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>导师信息详见：</span><a href=\"http://sic.hnu.edu.cn/teachers/people.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://sic.hnu.edu.cn/teachers/people.htm</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询联系方式：</span><span>0731-88820070 </span></span></p>\n<p><span>未尽事宜请广大推免生和考生留意学院网站通知。</span></p>\n\n\n</div>","textSha256":"6ab772940da10f9a12b36920f9b36790773c30cbf6e9fbd301bb882f23fe5724","textLength":365,"sourceSha256":"012871c2670450645b360014c7aa0f22